Package: fidms
Title: Process GC-MS/FID Peak Tables into Client Reports
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Philip", "Bulsink", , "pbulsink@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Replaces the "Automated Polyarc" Excel/VBA workflow. Parses
    Agilent FID and MSD peak tables plus MSD library-search exports, aligns
    the FID and MSD retention-time axes, identifies and interpolates
    compounds, quantifies them against a calibration table, classifies them
    into chemical families, and writes the client-facing Total Compound and
    Summary reports as Excel or PDF. Includes a local Shiny front end.
